Note on third-party components
------------------------------
This MIT license covers the project's own source code (Python backend, Canvas
frontend, packaging scripts and documentation).

The distributed portable build additionally bundles the KataGo analysis engine
and neural network files published by the KataGo project. KataGo is itself
released under the MIT license, with the exception of a few third-party
libraries under cpp/external/ that keep their own licenses. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and third_party/KataGo-LICENSE.txt.

Redistributing a build that includes KataGo therefore only requires keeping
the upstream copyright notice and permission notice; if you modify KataGo
itself, follow its LICENSE file for the third-party subdirectories.
